UID:B64o1ZR9eb
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 137 mins (2h17m)\n\nThe Modern Mastery of Paul Thoma
 s Anderson Joaquin Phoenix as WWII vet Freddie Quell falls into the orbit 
 of Philip Seymour Hoffman's self-styled prophet Lancaster Dodd in this tre
 mulous 1950s psychodrama.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/paul
 -thomas-anderson/the-master\n\nEstimated start: 3:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Punch Drunk Love (2002)
DTSTART:20250924T230000Z
DTEND:20250925T005000Z
DTSTAMP:20250924T230000Z
UID:dACepajmio
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nThe Modern Mastery of Paul Thomas
  Anderson Paul Thomas Anderson's surreal screwball romantic comedy has a w
 ildly experimental edge\, not least in Jon Brion's audacious score\, but t
 here's something euphoric about the entire irresistible project.\n\nhttps:
 //www.siff.net/programs-and-events/paul-thomas-anderson/punch-drunk-love\n
 \nEstimated start: 23:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Magnolia (1999)
DTSTART:20250925T014500Z
DTEND:20250925T051000Z
DTSTAMP:20250925T014500Z
UID:WDB0Y3IVTX
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 188 mins (3h08m)\n\nThe Modern Mastery of Paul Thoma
 s Anderson The fateful (or purely coincidental?) intertwining of nearly tw
 o dozen Los Angelinos’ lives searching for meaning in a spiteful world t
 hat unfolds over one chaotic day in Paul Thomas Anderson’s masterful tra
 gi-comedy about dreams\, despair\, quiz shows\, and a very special motivat
 ional speaker.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/paul-thomas-and
 erson/magnolia\n\nEstimated start: 2:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hard Eight (1996)
DTSTART:20250926T000000Z
DTEND:20250926T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20250926T000000Z
UID:5k6NxTgiRG
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 102 mins (1h42m)\n\nThe Modern Mastery of Paul Thoma
 s Anderson Paul Thomas Anderson's debut is a deceptively modest character 
 piece about a veteran gambler who takes a much younger man under his wing 
 and teaches him how to play the system and win. Until things take a darker
  turn...\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/paul-thomas-anderson/
 hard-eight\n\nEstimated start: 0:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:One Battle After Another
DTSTART:20250926T024500Z
DTEND:20250926T054500Z
DTSTAMP:20250926T024500Z
UID:ivVsiEvShE
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 161 mins (2h41m)\n\nWashed-up revolutionary Bob (Leo
 nardo DiCaprio) exists in a state of stoned paranoia\, surviving off-grid 
 with his spirited\, self-reliant daughter\, Willa (Chase Infiniti). When h
 is evil nemesis (Sean Penn) resurfaces after 16 years and she goes missing
 \, the former radical scrambles to find her\, father and daughter both bat
 tling the consequences of his past.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-thea
 ters/one-battle-after-another\n\nEstimated start: 3:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
